    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "been thinking a lot lately. seven years. my marriage ended, lost my best friend to cancer, this damn back pain that doesn't go away, my son moved to australia and i'm lucky if i get a text on my birthday. nothing exploded. it all just... quietly left.\n\ni keep thinking of it like a tide going out. not dramatic. just gradual. one day you look around and the beach is almost empty.\n\ndoes that ever reverse, do you think? or at some point is the sea just gone",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
